comments.body:
I started out killing Young Reef Crawlers, it took me about twenty minutes to get only two crawler legs.&nbsp; I moved up the coast North, closer to the actual Buzzbox (sort of like the quest says) and I got four in a row.&nbsp; 
Plus, the Young Reef Crawlers run away when they're almost dead, so they're a bit of a pain - The Pygmy Tide Crawlers just stand there and take it basically.
[b]The coordinates I was at when I got four in a row are: 36,48[/b]
